    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Imagine being trapped in an apartment where reality keeps shifting, where every loop takes you deeper into a mystery you don\u2019t quite understand. At first, you think you\u2019re searching for your missing sister\u2026 but the more you explore, the more you realize\u2014nothing is what it seems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perpetuo is a first-person psychological horror game where you relive the same apartment over and over, but each time, the walls remember more than you do. The furniture moves, objects disappear, and something lurks in the dark\u2014something that knows you\u2019re here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What to Expect</strong>:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Shifting Nightmare</strong>: The apartment changes with each loop, revealing new horrors and secrets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive Storytelling</strong>: Discover a haunting narrative through exploration and subtle environmental clues.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenging Puzzles</strong>: Every solution brings you closer to the truth\u2014or deeper into the nightmare.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unrelenting Tension</strong>: A lurking entity grows more unpredictable as you inch toward uncovering the past.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Concise Horror Experience</strong>: Perfectly crafted for fans of psychological terror and narrative-driven gameplay.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><br>Face the cycle. Break the loop. Or remain in it forever... in... Perpetuo.</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Imagine being trapped in an apartment where reality keeps shifting, where every loop takes you deeper into a mystery you don\u2019t quite understand. At first, you think you\u2019re searching for your missing sister\u2026 but the more you explore, the more you realize\u2014nothing is what it seems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perpetuo is a first-person psychological horror game where you relive the same apartment over and over, but each time, the walls remember more than you do. The furniture moves, objects disappear, and something lurks in the dark\u2014something that knows you\u2019re here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What to Expect</strong>:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Shifting Nightmare</strong>: The apartment changes with each loop, revealing new horrors and secrets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive Storytelling</strong>: Discover a haunting narrative through exploration and subtle environmental clues.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenging Puzzles</strong>: Every solution brings you closer to the truth\u2014or deeper into the nightmare.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unrelenting Tension</strong>: A lurking entity grows more unpredictable as you inch toward uncovering the past.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Concise Horror Experience</strong>: Perfectly crafted for fans of psychological terror and narrative-driven gameplay.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><br>Face the cycle. Break the loop. Or remain in it forever... in... Perpetuo.</strong></p>",
